    {
      "benign_id": "n08",
      "quirk": "Juice Shop's /ftp/ directory listing sends a body 59 bytes shorter than its Content-Length (11343 declared, 11284 sent). Reproduced inside the Docker network without nginx (wget from the nginx container straight to juice-shop:3000) and with curl through the proxy (curl exit 18). The arena client tolerates exactly this case: status returned, body_incomplete=true (contract 9)."
    }
